# Project content policy
# Keep only project-owned Wacom assets versioned. Ignore other Content assets
# by default so large marketplace/reference imports do not enter source control.
Content/*
!Content/Wacom/
!Content/Wacom/**

# Keep project source, config, Wacom content, plugins, and docs versioned.
